  "text_md": "## Table 30. Reserved Variable Names\n\n| *DATE   | The date the Print Database File Member job is requested.   |\n|---------|-------------------------------------------------------------|\n| *TIME   | The time the Print Database File Member job is requested.   |\n| *PAGNBR | The number of the page on which the record is printed.      |\n| *RCDNBR | The record number within the database file.                 |\n| *DBFIL  | The name of the database file to be printed.                |\n| *DBLIB  | The library name of the database file.                      |\n| *DBMBR  | The name of the member to be printed.                       |\n\nTo select reserved variable names, press the F4 key on the Define Text Detail (or the Define Box Detail) display. The following display appears:\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nThen press the F11 key. The following display appears:\n\n<!-- image -->",
